                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "As of 2026 All 3 defense zone games are virtually non doable in hard mode. As of 2025 they were doable. For some reason I can't even fathom the developer got his head up his ass and decided to tweak the game, or were the videos on YouTube completed because the players paid to win thru micro transactions? , Now playing any of these unbalanced pieces of shit you will get less coin than just one year ago, and the towers themselves will be weaker than before. I think most people play games for enjoyment, not to get frustrated. Even playing on easy mode in Defense zone 3 is a difficult task . So to the developer, think, do I want to be a dick head or do I want the people paying for my games to enjoy themselves.",
